    <h1>Explore the Wonderful Universe</h1>
    <p>Welcome to our space adventure! Discover amazing things about planets, stars, and galaxies.</p>

    <h2>Our Solar System</h2>
    <p>Our solar system contains eight planets that revolve around the Sun.</p>

    <h3>The Red Planet</h3>
    <p>Mars is called the Red Planet because its surface contains iron oxide.</p>

    <h4>The Largest Planet</h4>
    <p>Jupiter is the largest planet in our solar system and has a giant storm called the Great Red Spot.</p>

    <h5>Interesting Space Fact</h5>
    <p>Sound cannot travel through the vacuum of space.</p>

    <h6>Keep Exploring</h6>
    <p>There is always something new and exciting to discover beyond our planet.</p>

